inguishing it from other conditions like infection or neurological disorders.\"\n    ],\n    \"revised_selection\": \"Laboratory evaluation with serum glucose, pH, lactate, bicarbonate and ketone concentrations for diabetic ketoacidosis\",\n    \"confidence_change\": \"Increased\"\n}\n```",
